  <note>
    <title>Meeting Notes - Product Sync</title>
    <content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note>
<div>Meeting Notes from the weekly product sync.</div>
<div><br/></div>
<div><b>Attendees:</b> Matt, Stia, Reed</div>
<div><br/></div>
<div><b>Agenda:</b></div>
<ol>
<li>Review sprint progress</li>
<li>Discuss ENEX import approach</li>
<li>Plan next week's priorities</li>
</ol>
<div><br/></div>
<div><b>Decisions:</b></div>
<ul>
<li>Use streaming XML parser for large archives</li>
<li>Turndown for HTML→Markdown conversion</li>
<li>Preserve all metadata in YAML frontmatter</li>
</ul>
<div><br/></div>
<div><b>Action Items:</b></div>
<div><en-todo checked="false"/>Build ENEX parser (Stia)</div>
<div><en-todo checked="false"/>Write test cases (Reed)</div>
<div><en-todo checked="true"/>Set up project structure (Matt)</div>
</en-note>]]></content>
