  <note>
    <title>Quick Capture</title>
    <content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note>
<div>Just a quick thought to capture before I forget.</div>
<div><br/></div>
<div>The import tool should handle edge cases gracefully:</div>
<ul>
<li>Empty notes</li>
<li>Notes with only attachments</li>
<li>Very long titles that need truncation</li>
<li>Special characters in filenames: &amp; &lt; &gt; "quotes"</li>
<li>Unicode: 你好世界 🌍</li>
</ul>
</en-note>]]></content>
    <created>20260209T220000Z</created>
    <tag>ideas</tag>
  </note>
